Z||000000||ArchMagi||09-16-2001||11:27 PM||||My car starts sometimes.  Either it starts up laggy or it doesn't even crank at all.<BR>(i find if i shift though all 5 gears, sometimes it will start then)<P>I get a code 23 (mat) and once i start driving the CEL doesn't shut off.<P>The car also stumbles a bit and I had it backfire once.<P>Iv checked the battery and ground.  Alternator checked good.  Starter solenoid is good (herd the click) I apologize if I have left anything of importance out.<P>Any ideas? or what else should I check?<P>Thanks for the space.<P>------------------<BR>87 Coupe with 168,000KM<BR>4cyl, 5 speed||||reg||8
