Z||000004||Mickey_Moose||09-17-2001||08:20 PM||||sounds like a couple of problems...<P>as for the starting problem, I would suggest have the battery stress tested or have it replaced, I have seen brand new batteries go bad - the other problem is that the starter is no good.<P>as for the other problem with the MAP sensor - got me  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>Tim<BR>||||reg||1
