Z||000006||Spektrum-87GT||09-17-2001||08:51 PM||||as simple as it sounds, check your battery terminals and wires. i had a similar problem and after inspecting the wires, found they were very rusty. wire brushed them(if they're REALLY rusty dont be a cheap-skate like me, buy new ones) and fixed the problem, good luck!<P>------------------<BR>87 fiero gt under semi restoration/modification. progress at <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/spektrum_87gt/</A>||||reg||1
